<newsitem itemid="338643" id="root" date="1997-01-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Danka Business posts Q3 loss after charge.</title>
<headline>Danka Business posts Q3 loss after charge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 2.0		    vs 3.6 profit</p>
<p> Pretax loss		6.3		    vs 10.2 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   269.5		  vs 213.5</p>
<p>NOTE - As previously reported, above results include exceptional charges of 25.1 million stg in current Q3 related to the acquisition of Eastman Kodak Co's Office Imaging division versus 5.9 million stg in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Danka said it expected to take more charges in the fourth quarter as a result of the previously-announced deal.  </p>
<p>			    NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr (pence) profit	8.8		   vs 13.3</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    28.0		   vs 37.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   803.9		  vs 543.4</p>
<p>Full company name - Danka Business Systems Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
